null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/XoxR1G", "id": "394517381287914", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974591_394517384621247_1185750697019179008_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dD9mtsYiZbIQ7kNvwFp358_&_nc_oc=AdqexmdCyB7h-beleZNoaA9j7gWhfk88jEEQ2gGWWeCS-m2lTveug4v0oU7vSszom6o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQTd92a_NXiGyyTiwTHSKidS8OVu7A3z2VawhLKvRPauHQ&oe=6AFF0571"}, "display_name": "Video Poker VR", "keywords": ["casino", "poker", "cards", "relax"], "long_description": "Enjoy one of the most beloved casino games from the comfort of your home. Video Poker VR features all-you-can-play Jacks or Better video poker along with five other game modes. With classics likes Deuces Wild and Aces and Eights along with a new mode \"Five Fives\" you'll find a game you'll love to sit down and chill playing. \n\nFeatures \n\n- Six game modes: Jacks Or Better, Deuces Wild, Double Joker, Aces and Eights, Five Fives (NEW!, EXCLUSIVE), Pick and Draw \n- Play alongside NPC personalities including Smoking Martha! \n- Never pay for credits or sit around waiting for a time-based deposit, when you run out you can add more for free \n- Stats for how well you play over time (complete with a fancy graph)", "short_description": "Enjoy one of the most beloved casino games from the comfort of your home. Video Poker VR features all-you-can-play Jacks or Better video poker along with five other game modes. With classics likes Deuces Wild and Aces and Eights along with a new mode \"Five Fives\" you'll find a game you'll love to sit down and chill playing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Experience VR Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "